note as Rules
One enrollment per student per academic year (AK).
SectionAssignments keep placement history; at most one open placement.
AcademicYearId is carried redundantly so a composite FK guarantees the
section and the enrollment belong to the same year (deliberate denormalisation).
end note

legend right
  Domains: Identifier, Text(n), Integer, Decimal, Money, Percentage,
  Date, Time, Timestamp, Flag, Binary.  * = mandatory
  «PK» primary key  «FK» foreign key  «AKn» alternate key n
  {a | b} = allowed values.  Audit columns and physical-only
  columns (row version, period columns) are summarised.
